<div class="m5hautbas"><a class="button bfres" href="https://www.aquaportail.com/fiche-poisson-3567-hoplisoma-axelrodi.html"><span>&#x1f1eb;&#x1f1f7;&nbsp;&nbsp;en francés</span></a><span class="news floatright"><span class="bg_eee round4" style="padding:5px 4px"><span style="vertical-align:.07em">Compartir&#8239;: </span><a href="mailto:?body=Me%20gustaría%20recomendar%20esta%20página%20en%20AquaPortail.com%20sobre%20%22Hoplisoma%20axelrodi%22%20%3A%20%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aquaportail.com%2Fespecies%2Fficha%2Fpez%2F3567%2Fhoplisoma-axelrodi&amp;subject=Recomiendo%20esta%20página%20en%20AquaPortail" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank" class="linksoc" title="Compartir por correo electrónico"><i class="fas fa-envelope-open" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>&nbsp;<a onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('https://www.aquaportail.com/especies/ficha/pez/3567/hoplisoma-axelrodi');return true;" href=""  class="linksoc" title="Copiar enlace"><i class="fas fa-link" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>&nbsp;<a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aquaportail.com%2Fespecies%2Fficha%2Fpez%2F3567%2Fhoplisoma-axelrodi&#038;title=Hoplisoma+axelrodi" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank" class="linksoc" title="Compartir Facebook"><i class="fas fa-facebook fa-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>&nbsp;<a href="https://x.com/share?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aquaportail.com%2Fespecies%2Fficha%2Fpez%2F3567%2Fhoplisoma-axelrodi&#038;text=Hoplisoma+axelrodi" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank" class="linksoc" title="Compartir X (twitter)"><i class="fas fa-x-twitter fa-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>&nbsp;<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aquaportail.com%2Fespecies%2Fficha%2Fpez%2F3567%2Fhoplisoma-axelrodi&#038;title=Hoplisoma+axelrodi" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank" class="linksoc" title="Compartir LinkedIn"><i class="fas fa-linkedin fa-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>&nbsp;</span></span></div><article class="news"><h1 id="leh1"><i>Hoplisoma axelrodi</i></h1><div><span class="sprite-bleu">Resumen&#8239;:</span></div><nav class="navft15 p5px" role="navigation" aria-label="Resumen" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList"><meta itemprop="name" content="Resumen"><span class="breadcrumb" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem">| <a class="smallbutton bg_nav" href="#lapresentacion" itemprop="item" title="Presentación"><span itemprop="name">Presentación</span></a><meta itemprop="position" content="1"></span>
<span class="breadcrumb" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem">| <a class="smallbutton bg_nav" href="#ladescripcion" itemprop="item" title="Descripción"><span itemprop="name">Descripción</span></a><meta itemprop="position" content="2"></span>
<span class="breadcrumb" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem">| <a class="smallbutton bg_nav" href="#lagua" itemprop="item" title="Ajustes"><span itemprop="name">Ajustes</span></a><meta itemprop="position" content="3"></span>
<span class="breadcrumb" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem">| <a class="smallbutton bg_nav" href="#elcomportamiento" itemprop="item" title="Comportamiento"><span itemprop="name">Comportamiento</span></a><meta itemprop="position" content="4"></span>
